# Cloudflare Pages redirects. One rule per line: <from> <to> <status>
# Order matters — first match wins. Max 2,000 static rules.

# --- Squarespace leftovers -------------------------------------------------
# Squarespace kept a duplicate of the homepage at /homepage. It was in your
# sitemap with priority 1.0, competing with "/" for the same query.
/homepage            /                    301

# The commerce cart page. It was noindex and had nothing on it.
/cart                /                    301

# Squarespace system paths that sometimes pick up stray links.
/config              /                    301
/config/*            /                    301

# --- Add future URL changes below -----------------------------------------
# If you ever rename a page, add the old path here rather than letting it 404.
# Example:
# /old-page-name     /new-page-name       301

